{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Interview met Eric Fischer in het kader van proefschrift Nederlandse akkoorden over Joodse oorlogstegoeden (1997-2000)"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:76925"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"C.J. Ruppert"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"C.J.  Ruppert"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Gehouden interview met Eric Fischer in het kader van het proefschrift Eindelijk 'restitutie'. De totstandkoming van Nederlandse akkoorden over Joodse oorlogstegoeden.<br>Interview met Fischer voormalig directeur van het Verbond van Verzekeraars, gehouden op 3 en 10 oktober 2013 in Amsterdam.  Fischer is vanaf 1997- 2000 in overleg met het CJO om een akkoord over Joodse polissen te bereiken. Na het in november 1999 in Nederland gesloten akkoord gaat hij in 2000 veelvuldig naar de VS om het akkoord te verdedigen.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Oral History"}}